ed sed lobortis justo, ut tincidunt\r\n                            velit. Mauris in maximus eros.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </main>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div className=\"lg lg0 lg0 lg1/2\">\r\n            <img className=\"h-56 w-full object-cover object-top sm72 md96 lg lg\" src=\"https://cdn.pixabay.com/photo/2016/03/23/04/01/woman-1274056_960_720.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
